{"id":"632293410","kind":"answer","title":"怎么让自己学习记得更牢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2019-03-25","updated":"2019-03-25","votes":6,"comment_count":1,"minutes":1,"chars":408,"keywords":["间隔重复","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki","遗忘曲线"],"summary":"从记忆理论上来说： 间隔重复 + 测试效应 两者结合效果很好，但是只是理论，以我刷知乎的个人经验，只有理论的回答几乎帮不上忙 所以我就介绍一下可以半个小时内开始，并能坚持一年以上的实际操作方法：借助 Anki 来进行学习。 先发几张使用过程中的图片 简单介绍：Anki 是一款有 记忆 辅助算法的 笔记 软件，支持常见的 win…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/317220010/answer/632293410","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"xuM9coQl\">从记忆理论上来说：</p><p data-pid=\"dwT5yYI4\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57020308\" href=\"#/post/57020308\">间隔重复</a>+ <a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57113246\" href=\"#/post/57113246\">测试效应</a></p><p data-pid=\"v5SFy4rO\">两者结合效果很好，但是只是理论，以我刷知乎的个人经验，只有理论的回答几乎帮不上忙</p><p data-pid=\"8QleAfS6\">所以我就介绍一下可以半个小时内开始，并能坚持一年以上的实际操作方法：借助 Anki 来进行学习。</p><p data-pid=\"pZnE99bI\">先发几张使用过程中的图片</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e17ffca9d00f77f06dd335631fc4aba8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ec139c3da7839ca1ddf771caeb5e91c5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1af7c2ed8d2a18aa49d96d4fb8526b2a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1062\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e17ffca9d00f77f06dd335631fc4aba8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ec139c3da7839ca1ddf771caeb5e91c5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-1af7c2ed8d2a18aa49d96d4fb8526b2a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1062\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"o