=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2eb3267a69879acc88634e8c4e328d33_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1062\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0eee92339a7283de0f0f007089e9242c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f9323db737b41fcc19b188f0c976e404\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2eb3267a69879acc88634e8c4e328d33_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1062\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"FQ5Y6hPe\">简单介绍：Anki 是一款有<b>记忆</b>辅助算法的<b>笔记</b>软件，支持常见的 windows、mac、linux、安卓和 ios 系统。</p><p data-pid=\"y8wy4Rdk\">快速入门方式：</p><p data-pid=\"Z9w-0pWQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.kancloud.cn/ankigaokao/ankigaokao\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki 备战高考手册 · 看云</a> </p><p data-pid=\"leisVYez\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/av41518619\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ankidroid (Anki 安卓版) 基本使用教程</a> </p><p data-pid=\"pACMKtKf\">笔记获取：</p><p data-pid=\"LNvFdHDq\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/40144454\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2698张体验卡片，带每一位高中生进入Anki学习法的世界</a></p><p data-pid=\"k7OurTdO\">最后，说一些自己踩过的坑：</p><p data-pid=\"YbkO4gV3\">千万不要看太多学习方法，实践为主。以及，没有给出理论和实际相结合的学习方法，哪怕再科学与正确，也没有多大用处，反而会给人带来一种感觉良好。</p><p data-pid=\"eiigJuq0\">最后，给一下我自己高考前的学习统计数据：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-60e193b770b8465db4e684d76dbb16d5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ee60d0c21d662c8b5e6f9ede92671e3c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f574c9463a44f5ccd3d3bc54c7b23b86_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1665\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-60e193b770b8465db4e684d76dbb16d5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ee60d0c21d662c8b5e6f9ede92671e3c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f574c9463a44f5ccd3d3bc54c7b23b86_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1665\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"CPL3-1La\">不妨抽帮个小时，少看几篇理论，多实践一个方法。</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46533104","title":"疑问:Anki 没有向我展示我的所有卡片！","author":"Anki","votes":12,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"38306259","title":"简单常见记忆误区解惑","author":"SuperMemo","votes":29,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · SuperMemo"},{"id":"6046109771","title":"如何追赶积压的 Anki 复习任务","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":209,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1005545481","title":"有哪些实用学习的APP可以推荐一下？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":66,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 66 赞同"},{"id":"995551831","title":"记忆力不好，怎么才能在短时间内最大限度的学习知识？学习方法都有哪些？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":17,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 17 赞同"},{"id":"749742933","title":"高三应该如何将三轮复习的效率最大化？理科？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":57,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 57 赞同"},{"id":"1882739659","title":"Anki 怎么用高效？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":241,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 241 赞同"},{"id":"1024915739","title":"有没有什么好用的手机学习软件？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":17,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 17 赞同"}]}